{
  "format": "candid-profile",
  "format_version": 0,
  "kind": "contract",
  "name": "x402-exact-permit2",
  "origin": "third_party",
  "language": "en",
  "description": "x402's `exact` payment through Permit2 (spec section 15.9, experimental): Permit2's PermitWitnessTransferFrom with x402's witness, Witness(address to,uint256 validAfter), which x402 uses for tokens without EIP-3009 (coinbase/x402, specs/schemes/exact/scheme_exact_evm.md). Permit2 lets the spender choose where the tokens go and never reads the witness, so the witness's `to` is the payee only when the spender is x402's proxy, 0x402085c248EeA27D92E8b30b2C58ed07f9E20001, whose `settle` sends exactly `permitted.amount` to `witness.to`, not before `validAfter` (contracts/evm/src/x402BasePermit2Proxy.sol). The spender is therefore fixed to the proxy, and a request with any other spender gets no text (E_FIXED). Bound to Permit2's domain and deployments; the proxy has the same code on each of these chains (read on chain on 2026-10-30). Amounts are in the token the message names: a consumer supplies that token's decimals() and symbol(), and shows its address beside the symbol.",
  "binds": {
    "eip712": {
      "domain": {
        "name": "Permit2"
      },
      "types": {
        "PermitWitnessTransferFrom": [
          {
            "name": "permitted",
            "type": "TokenPermissions"
          },
          {
            "name": "spender",
            "type": "address"
          },
          {
            "name": "nonce",
            "type": "uint256"
          },
          {
            "name": "deadline",
            "type": "uint256"
          },
          {
            "name": "witness",
            "type": "Witness"
          }
        ],
        "TokenPermissions": [
          {
            "name": "token",
            "type": "address"
          },
          {
            "name": "amount",
            "type": "uint256"
          }
        ],
        "Witness": [
          {
            "name": "to",
            "type": "address"
          },
          {
            "name": "validAfter",
            "type": "uint256"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "deployments": [
      {
        "chain_id": 1,
        "address": "0x000000000022D473030F116dDEE9F6B43aC78BA3"
      },
      {
        "chain_id": 8453,
